WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.310
Start in AI Assistant and choose Form Mode.

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:07.290
Give the ticket a searchable title: headset microphone cuts out.

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:13.540
In the description, say which unit failed, what the instructor heard, and what you did to keep the class running.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.060
Continue to category.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:19.920
Choose Repair and Maintenance, then Audio, Mic and Headphone Malfunction.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.230
Check the suggested priority and routing.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.490
Select the studio where the fault occurred.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:30.120
Complete any relevant people and detail fields; leave optional information blank if you don't know it.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:34.700
On the review screen, read the title, category and studio back to yourself.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.110
Select Create Ticket just once.

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:40.560
Open the new row in All Tickets and note its ticket number.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:43.560
Reloading the workspace shows the same saved record.
